# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║       SECTION 2 — VIEW DAILY ATTENDANCE (GET)           ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 2A. Today's attendance — by numeric user_id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/daily/3

###

### 2B. Today's attendance — by uvfin
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/daily/VF-2024-001

###

### 2C. Specific date — by numeric user_id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/daily/3?date=2026-07-21

###

### 2D. Specific date — by uvfin
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/daily/VF-2024-001?date=2026-07-21

###


# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║       SECTION 3 — VIEW WEEKLY ATTENDANCE (GET)          ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 3A. Current week — by numeric user_id (no date → uses today)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/weekly/3

###

### 3B. Current week — by uvfin
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/weekly/VF-2024-001

###

### 3C. Specific week containing a date — by user_id
###     Returns Mon-Sun range of the ISO week containing 2026-07-21
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/weekly/3?date=2026-07-21

###

### 3D. Specific week — by uvfin
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/weekly/VF-2024-001?date=2026-07-21

###


# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║      SECTION 4 — VIEW MONTHLY ATTENDANCE (GET)          ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 4A. Monthly by numeric user_id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/monthly/3?month=July&year=2026

###

### 4B. Monthly by uvfin
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/monthly/VF-2024-001?month=July&year=2026

###

### 4C. Different month/year
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/monthly/3?month=June&year=2026

###


