GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/record/1

###

### 7B. Another strict lookup
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/record/42

###

### 7C. Smart lookup — numeric → single record
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/1

###

### 7D. Smart lookup — text → faculty history
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/VF-2024-001

###


# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║             SECTION 8 — ADMIN ENDPOINTS                 ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 8A. Get ALL attendance (no filters)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/admin

###

### 8B. Filter by facultyId (numeric)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/admin?facultyId=3

###

### 8C. Filter by uvfin
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/admin?facultyId=VF-2024-001

###

### 8D. Filter by month + year
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/admin?month=July&year=2026

###

### 8E. Filter by status
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/admin?status=Pending

###

### 8F. Filter by attendance_period (new!)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/admin?attendance_period=daily

###

### 8G. Filter by attendance_period = weekly
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/admin?attendance_period=weekly

###

### 8H. Filter by attendance_period = monthly
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/admin?attendance_period=monthly

###

### 8I. Combine multiple filters
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/admin?facultyId=3&month=July&year=2026&status=Pending&attendance_period=daily

###


# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║        SECTION 9 — ADMIN VERIFY / APPROVE (PATCH)       ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 9A. Approve (mark as Present)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/verify/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "Present",
    "remarks": "Verified by admin"
}

###

### 9B. Mark as Absent
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/verify/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "Absent",
    "remarks": "Faculty was absent on this date"
}

###

### 9C. Reset to Pending
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/verify/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "Pending"
}

###


# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║           SECTION 10 — VALIDATION / ERROR TESTS         ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

### 10A. Missing required fields (daily) → expect 400
POST http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/mark/daily
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": 3
}

###

### 10B. Missing month+year (monthly) → expect 400
POST http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/mark/monthly
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user_id": 3,
    "course_id": 1,
    "semester_id": 2,
    "subject_id": 5,
    "attendance_date": "2026-07-10",
    "start_time": "09:00:00",
    "end_time": "10:00:00",
    "hours": 1
}

###

### 10C. Non-numeric attendance_id (strict) → expect 400
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/record/abc

###

### 10D. Non-existent attendance_id (strict) → expect 404
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/record/999999

###

### 10E. Faculty not found → expect 500
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/daily/INVALID-ID

###

### 10F. Verify without status → expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/verify/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 10G. Monthly filter missing month → still returns results filtered by year only
GET http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/monthly/3?year=2026

###